buyHit = hit240L or hit210L or hit150L or hit120L or hit90L or hit60L or hit45L or hit30L or hit27L or hit24L or hit21L or hit18L or hit15L
sellHit = hit240S or hit210S or hit150S or hit120S or hit90S or hit60S or hit45S or hit30S or hit27S or hit24S or hit21S or hit18S or hit15S

